    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy Crush: Seduction in Motion is a real-time match-3 puzzle game that challenges both your speed and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698620/extras/83fdf24cb706d5e251dc41fc11d33807.avif?t=1750698127\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move jewel-shaped puzzle blocks to align three or more of the same shape horizontally or vertically \u2014 and watch them disappear! Master quick moves and clever combos to achieve your stage goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional match-3 games, Sexy Crush introduces a real-time system that adds an exciting layer of urgency and thrill. You must clear stages by meeting specific objectives within a strict time limit \u2014 no endless thinking allowed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698620/extras/fdd4fd0ca4cba3cedb61e05dfb786154.avif?t=1750698127\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) 100 Stage Time Attack: Clear 100 challenging stages as fast as you can before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Break the AI Record: Beat the clear times set by AI-controlled players \u2014 a true test of skill and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698620/extras/7b7753cfaa06078b66dd357476bef3fd.avif?t=1750698127\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock stunning photos and videos as you progress, revealing hidden rewards for the fastest and most strategic players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to experience puzzle seduction in motion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy Crush: Seduction in Motion is a real-time match-3 puzzle game that challenges both your speed and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698620/extras/83fdf24cb706d5e251dc41fc11d33807.avif?t=1750698127\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move jewel-shaped puzzle blocks to align three or more of the same shape horizontally or vertically \u2014 and watch them disappear! Master quick moves and clever combos to achieve your stage goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional match-3 games, Sexy Crush introduces a real-time system that adds an exciting layer of urgency and thrill. You must clear stages by meeting specific objectives within a strict time limit \u2014 no endless thinking allowed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698620/extras/fdd4fd0ca4cba3cedb61e05dfb786154.avif?t=1750698127\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) 100 Stage Time Attack: Clear 100 challenging stages as fast as you can before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Break the AI Record: Beat the clear times set by AI-controlled players \u2014 a true test of skill and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698620/extras/7b7753cfaa06078b66dd357476bef3fd.avif?t=1750698127\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock stunning photos and videos as you progress, revealing hidden rewards for the fastest and most strategic players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to experience puzzle seduction in motion?</p>",
